{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00596","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享龙池乐章 第七章 · 苏頲","name":"郊庙歌辞 享龙池乐章 第七章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西京凤邸跃龙泉，佳气休光镇在天。\n轩后雾图今已得，秦王水劒昔常传。\n恩鱼不似昆明钓，瑞鹤长如太液仙。\n愿侍巡游同旧里，更闻箫鼓济楼船。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00596.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00596","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}